h1: Car Stuck in Park? How to Get an Automatic Into Neutral
lede: Flat battery, gear selector stuck in P, and the car won't move an inch? Most automatics have a hidden override, but where it is varies by make, and plenty of garages don't know. This is what our recovery drivers actually do, make by make.
side_title: Stuck in Park now?
